ementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cegid Primavera V10 - Contabilidade<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f5a8d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f5a8d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>O m\u00f3dulo Financeiro do Cegid Primavera V10 proporciona um suporte abrangente e robusto \u00e0 sua empresa, garantindo solidez or\u00e7amental e fiabilidade contabil\u00edstica. Esta solu\u00e7\u00e3o avan\u00e7ada oferece uma gest\u00e3o financeira integrada e eficiente, fundamental para o sucesso do seu neg\u00f3cio.<\/p><p>O processo de introdu\u00e7\u00e3o de documentos no Cegid Primavera V10 &#8211; Contabilidade \u00e9 notavelmente \u00e1gil e intuitivo.<\/p><p>Gra\u00e7as aos m\u00f3dulos de integra\u00e7\u00e3o altamente sofisticados, o Cegid Primavera V10 &#8211; Contabilidade assegura uma sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o perfeita de todos os movimentos do seu ERP.<\/p><p>Esta integra\u00e7\u00e3o abrangente proporciona uma vis\u00e3o hol\u00edstica e em tempo real da situa\u00e7\u00e3o financeira da sua empresa, facilitando a tomada de decis\u00f5es estrat\u00e9gicas e o cumprimento das obriga\u00e7\u00f5es fiscais.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e36d96 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7e36d96\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e31553e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e31553e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"740\" height=\"493\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/analista-de-cooperacao-grafico-economia-de-papel-profissional_1418-47.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-13072\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/analista-de-cooperacao-grafico-economia-de-papel-profissional_1418-47.jpg 740w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/analista-de-cooperacao-grafico-economia-de-papel-profissional_1418-47-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c643170 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"